<title>USA: PSE to list Titanium Metals options Dec 6.</title>
<headline>PSE to list Titanium Metals options Dec 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said Tuesday it would list options on Titanium Metals Corp on December 6.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and expirations in December, January, April and July.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to market makers Cole, Roesler &amp; Associates.</p>
<p>Titanium shares were off 1/8 at 35-3/4 Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, (312) 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
